# three constraints and one noun. Matching all five words as text finds nothing;
# reading four of them as filters and one as the noun finds the dentist.
#
# Each rule is (constraint name, value, [patterns]). Patterns are matched on the
# normalized query and REMOVED from it, so what is left is the thing itself.
# A site applies only the constraints it has data for and says so — a filter
